# opening the entry takes off its row.
text 5375 3a67a7ed810f9c7bc65a38d80050a17ec7fcc28a635a39220e40eb0894546271
text 5525 50fc10e9174753a9d0cff521ab74e0674df55b4235ef8f07f1f05e71fbba2c92
text 5825 664b57cdf489b3c7829659df16db1cb811b4953b611304c9a95c1d6527c761a9
text 7025 3ce4409c3d7da571e86dfd71b88a00bc1f989ec710ddc1f8f2906b98d6c4e6b7

# The screen the reader took, back again after it: every pixel, the bar
